      "title": "Faculty & Staff",
      "description": "Faculty & Staff | Lake Erie College top of page Search Apply Give VISIT Make a Payment LEO More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. Menu Close About History News and Announcements Faculty & Staff Board of Directors Accreditation Events Admissions Campus Tours Tuition & Fees Housing & Dining Financial Aid College Credit Plus (CCP) Office of Veterans and Military Service New Student Orientation Academics Academic Calendar Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Physician Assistant Program (PA) Study Abroad Partnerships & Pre-Professional Programs Professional Teacher Pathway Registrar Student Life Clubs & Organizations Tower Honors Program Career Development Career Closet Lincoln Learning Commons Campus Safety Non-Degree Programs Professional Development for Teachers Equine Studies Athletics Arts & Culture Alumni & Friends Parents & Family Careers Facilities Bookstore Campus Gear LAKE ERIE ONLINE Faculty & Staff FACULTY Megan Acord, M.S. Assistant Professor of Biology macord@lec.edu John Anderson, MSPAS, PA-C Academic Coordinator and Clinical Assistant Professor, Physician Assistant Program joanderson@lec.edu Paola Basile, PhD Professor of Italian and French PBasile@lec.edu Bethany Baxley, PhD Assistant Professor of Equine Studies bbaxley@lec.edu Victoria Boulos, PhD Assistant Professor of Chemistry, Program Director of Chemistry/Physics vboulos@lec.edu Michael Cinotti, DVM Equine Studies Faculty & Resident Veterinarian mcinotti@lec.edu Amanda Curtis, PhD Dean of the School of Business, Professor of Sport Management acurtis@lec.edu Kacey DiVincenzo, DMSc, PA-C Research and Outcomes Coordinator kdivincenzo@lec.edu Ryan Fairall, PhD Assistant Professor of Exercise Science, Program Director of Exercise Science/Nutrition rfairall@lec.edu Aibak Hafeez, PhD Assistant Professor of Human Resource Management ahafeez@lec.edu Darlene Hall, PhD Professor of History dhall@lec.edu Emily Hoopes-Boyd, PhD Assistant Professor of Applied Mathematics, Honors