 Professor of Visual Arts gsummanen@lec.edu Jennifer Swartz-Levine, PhD Professor of English jswartz@lec.edu Leatra Tate, PhD Assistant Professor of Psychology, Program Director of Psychology ltate@lec.edu Johnathan Tedesco, PhD Associate Provost and Dean of the School of Science, Animal Studies & Human Services jtedesco@lec.edu Dale Turley, MMS, PA-C Assistant Clinical Coordinator dturley@lec.edu Robert Walter Instructor of HVACR rwalter@lec.edu Steven Zigman, PA-C Skills Coordinator & Clinical  Assistant Professor szigman@lec.edu Staff Justine Barnum Staff Accountant and Director of the Bookstore jbarnum@lec.edu Nancy Bolden Controller nbolden@lec.edu Jake Bolton PT Security Officer jbolton@lec.edu Mike Brail Director of Information Technology mbrail@lec.edu Tricia Brass Administrative Assistant, School of Education tbrass@lec.edu Rudy Braydich Vice President of Advancement rbraydich@lec.edu Shawn Brewster Carpenter & Maintenance Technician sbrewster@lec.edu Thomas Buehner Security Officer tbuehner@lec.edu Dan Call Director of Co-Curricular Music & Theater dcall@lec.edu Aaron Call Security Officer acall@lec.edu Suzanne Carle Philanthropy Officer scarle@lec.edu Bridget Conway Coordinator of Graduate Programs & School of Business Advising bconway@lec.edu Robert Daubenmire Security Officer rdaubenmire@lec.edu Paul Deck Mail Room & Print Shop Supervisor pdeck@lec.edu Adam Delamotte Physical Plant Maintenance Technician addelamotte@lec.edu Erin Delffs Vice President of Finance edelffs@lec.edu Lauren Feola Assistant Registrar lfeola@lec.edu Paul Fidalgo Grants & Communications Specialist pfidalgo@lec.edu Kelly Florentine Program Assistant for the Physician Assistant Program kflorentine@lec.edu Natasha Gaines Assistant Registrar - Student Data Specialist ngaines@lec.edu Vonda Gardner Security Officer vgardner@lec.edu Angela Griggs Administrative Assistant for Physical Plant agriggs@lec.edu Rachel Hanni Vice President for HR & Operations rhanni@lec.edu Soujanya Indugu Database Specialist sindugu@lec.edu Tom Katoch Equestrian Facilities Manager tkatoch@lec.edu Rick Kline Director of Safety and Security rkline@lec.edu Rachel Lehtonen Executive Assistant of Academics and Operations rlehtonen@lec.edu Dean Light Security Officer dlight@lec.edu Cody Loze IT Infrastructure Manager cloze@lec.edu Brad Luhta IT Systems Strategist bluhta@lec.edu Martha Mansfield Accounts Receivable Coordinator MMansfield@lec.edu Hannah Matasich Horse Care Manager hmatasich@lec.edu Ashley Mayse Vice President for Enrollment amayse@lec.edu Alison McBrady Director of Financial Aid amcbrady@lec.edu Alyssa McIntyre Director of Admission & Retention amcintyre@lec.edu Thomas Meeks Director of Physical Plant tmeeks@lec.edu Madison Meyer Director of Public Relations and Marketing mmeyer@lec.edu Nathan Miller IT Support Technician namiller@lec.edu Kelsea Minks Coordinator of Equine Studies kminks@lec.edu Timothy Neary Academic Support Coordinator tneary@lec.edu Marlene O'Brien Program Assistant for the Physician Assistant Program mobrien@lec.edu Kevin O'Brien Database Strategist kobrien@lec.edu Jennifer Pacheco PCLS Teacher Assistant Pathways Learning Center jepacheco@lec.edu Kim Plaatje Assistant Director of Financial Aid kplaatje@lec.edu Tammy Plants Senior Admission Counselor tplants@lec.edu Leslie Ray Director of HR lray@lec.edu Debra Remington Special Assistant to the President DRemington@lec.edu Erika Ruedin Director of Future Educators eruedin@lec.edu Melissa Sadowski Security Officer msadowski@lec.edu Megan Sattler Bursar msattler@lec.edu Jennifer Schuller President jschuller@lec.edu Catherine Schultz Director of Alumni Relations and Annual Giving cschultz@lec.edu Jared Schwenk Laboratory Manager & Instructor jschwenk@lec.edu Duane Seacrist Physical Plant dseacrist@lec.edu Hannah Secre Visit & Event Coordinator hsecre@lec.edu Lyric Stancliff Academic Advisor lstancliff@lec.edu Sara Wilson Staff Accountant sawilson@lec.edu Bryce Zwagerman Admission Counselor bzwa