    "https://www.lec.edu/board-of-directors": {
      "title": "Board of Directors",
      "description": "Board of Directors | Lake Erie College top of page Skip to Main Content Search Apply Give VISIT Make a Payment LEO More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. Menu Board of Directors Patricia A. Nocero Class of 1973 Ric Selby ​ Bill Haag ​ Carolyn Terrell Coatoam Class of 1968 and 1975 Doris Bray Class of 1959 Ray DelaMotte, Jr. Class of 1959 and 1987 Suzanne Schoedinger Ellis ​ Gary Fedak Class of 1997 Kevin Malecek ​ Shana Miskovsky ​ Pam Morse ​ Robert G. Morris ​ Carol Niemi Class of 1974 Jean M. Perloff Class of 1965 Don Purtill ​ Scott Schulick ​ Marilyn Schutz Class of 1968 Dan Serbin ​ Dan Smith ​ Nancy Stillwagon Class of 1970 Jesse Styles ​ Jack Turben ​ Lisa Ward ​ Jen Yorko Class of 2007 Bob Zappitelli ​ Visit Campus Overview Apply Request Info 391 W Washington St, Painesville, Ohio, 44077 440.375.7000 © 2026 Lake Erie College Campus Map Catalog and School Handbook Compliments and Complaints Consumer Information Make a Payment APPLY VISIT Give Lake Erie Online Close About History News and Announcements Faculty & Staff Board of Directors Accreditation Events Admissions Campus Tours Tuition & Fees Housing & Dining Financial Aid College Credit Plus (CCP) Office of Veterans and Military Service New Student Orientation Academics Academic Calendar Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Physician Assistant Program (PA) Study Abroad Partnerships & Pre-Professional Programs Professional Teacher Pathway Registrar Student Life Clubs & Organizations Tower Honors Program Career Development Career Closet Lincoln Learning Commons Campus Safety Non-Degree Programs Professional Development for Teachers Equine Studies Athletics Arts & Culture Alumni & Friends Parents & Family Careers Facilities Bookstore Campus Gear LAKE ERIE ONLINE bottom of page Double click the content to see meaning"
