4-8/28: Add/Drop Period 9/7: Labor Day (no classes) 9/23: Mountain Day (no classes) 9/25: 5-week downgrade due 10/5-10/9: Advising and Registration – Honors/Vets/Seniors/GR/PB 10/14: Midterm Grades due, 8am 10/12-10/16: Advising and Registration – Juniors 10/19: Last day to Withdraw “W” 10/22-10/23: Fall Break (no classes) 10/26-10/30: Advising and Registration – Sophomores 11/2-11/6: Advising and Registration – Freshmen/CCP 11/23-11/27: Thanksgiving Break (no classes) 12/11: Last Day of Class 12/14-12/17: Finals Week 12/18: Final Grades due, 8am 12/21: Conferral Date Session X: 1st 7-weeks 8/24-10/9 8/25: Last day to Add/Drop 9/21: Last day to Withdraw “W” 10/14: Final Grades due, 8am Session Y: 2nd 7-weeks 10/12-12/4 10/13: Last day to Add/Drop 11/9: Last day to Withdraw “W” 12/9: Final Grades due, 8am 12/21: Conferral Date Spring Session Important Dates Full Semester: (All Students) 1/11-5/6 1/11-1/15: Add/Drop Period 1/18: Martin Luther King Jr. Day (no classes) 2/12: 5-week downgrade due 2/22-2/26: Advising and Registration – Honors/Vets/Seniors/GR/PB 3/1-3/5: Advising and Registration – Juniors 3/3: Midterm Grades due, 8am 3/8-3/12: Spring Break (no classes) 3/15: Last day to Withdraw “W” 3/15-3/19: Advising and Registration – Sophomores 3/22-3/26: Advising and Registration – Freshmen/CCP 3/29: Spring Holiday (no classes) 4/30: Spring Fest (no classes) 5/3-5/6: Finals Week 5/7: Final Grades due, 8am 5/8: Commencement and Conferral Date ​ Session X: 1st 7-weeks 1/11-2/26 1/12: Last day to Add/Drop 2/8: Last day to Withdraw “W” 3/3: Final Grades due, 8am Session Y: 2nd 7-weeks 3/1-4/23 3/2: Last day to Add/Drop 4/5: Last day to Withdraw “W” 4/28: Final Grades due, 8am 5/8: Commencement and Conferral Date ​ Academic Calendar Office of THE REGISTRAR Lauren Feola Assistant Registrar Lyric Stancliff Academic Advisor Visit Campus Overview Apply Request Info 391 W Washington St, Painesville, Ohio, 44077 440.375.7000 © 2026 Lake Erie College Campus Map Catalog and School Handbook Compliments and Complaints Consumer Information Make a Payment APPLY VISIT Give Lake Erie Online Close About History News and Announcements Faculty & Staff Board of Directors Accreditation Events Admissions Campus Tours Tuition & Fees Housing & Dining Financial Aid College Credit Plus (CCP) Office of Veterans and Military Service New Student Orientation Academics Academic Calendar Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Physician Assistant Program (PA) Study Abroad Partnerships & Pre-Professional Programs Professional Teacher Pathway Registrar Student Life Clubs & Organizations Tower Honors Program Career Development Career Closet Lincoln Learning Commons Campus Safety Non-Degree Programs Professional Development for Teachers Equine Studies Athletics Arts & Culture Alumni & Friends Parents & Family Careers Facilities Bookstore Campus Gear LAKE ERIE ONLINE bottom of page Double click the content to see meaning"
